WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:09.560
2nd century AD · Llandough hill, above the
Ely

2
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:19.660
In the 2nd century AD a Roman villa is
built on this hill

3
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:24.834
Look at it. A house of stone, up here on
top of the hill.

4
00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:32.760
Stone lasts. Timber rots and thatch burns.
This will stand long after we're gone.

5
00:00:38.418 --> 00:00:43.159
Then let them build it right. The children
will grow up under that roof.

6
00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:48.064
From the river down there, they'll see it
standing on the hill.

